{"text": "Behind the rotunda the slender trees with yellow leaves hung down, and through them she could see a line of sea and the blue sky with gold veined clouds. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Two young girls in red came by, and two young soldiers in blue met them, and they laughed and paired off and went away arm in arm. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Two peasant women in funny straw hats passed, gravely leading beautiful smoke colored donkeys, and a cold, pale nun hurried by. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A beautiful woman came along and dropped her bunch of violets, and a little boy ran after her to hand them back to her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She took them and threw them away as if they had been poisoned, and Miss Brill did not know whether to admire that or not. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then a woman in an ermine toque met a gentleman in grey right in front of her, and even her face was the color of the shabby ermine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was delighted to see him and talked brightly, but he shook his head, slowly breathed a great puff of smoke into her face, and walked on. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Left alone, she smiled more brightly than ever while the drum beat The Brute, The Brute, and then she pretended to see someone nicer and pattered away.", "alignment": {"characters": ["B", "e", "h", "i", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "r", "o", "t", "u", "n", "d", "a", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "l", "e", "n", "d", "e", "r", " ", "t", "r", "e", "e", "s", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "y", "e", "l", "l", "o", "w", " ", "l", "e", "a", "v", "e", "s", " ", "h", "u", "n", "g", " ", "d", "o", "w", "n", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "r", "o", "u", "g", "h", " ", "t", "h", "e", "m", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "c", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "s", "e", "e", " ", "a", " ", "l", "i", "n", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "s", "e", "a", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "l", "u", "e", " ", "s", "k", "y", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "g", "o", "l", "d", " ", "v", "e", "i",